    <a class="nav__brand" href="/" aria-label="VastuFirst — home">
      <LogoMark size={26} tone="ink" />
      <span class="wordmark" style="font-size:17px;color:#F8F6F0">Vastu<em>First</em></span>
    </a>
    <div class="footer__meta">
      <a href="/privacy">Privacy</a>
      <a href="mailto:hello@vastufirst.com">Contact</a>
      <span>Vastu before you build · © {year} VastuFirst</span>
    </div>
  </div>

  <p class="footer__disclaimer">
    Vastu Shastra is a traditional discipline, not a science, and nothing here is a prediction or a
    promise about health, wealth, marriage or fortune. VastuFirst presents traditional prescription,
    names the source behind every rule, and shows both readings where the schools genuinely disagree.
  </p>
</footer>
